# Production configuration template (Phase 17). Copy to
# `frontend/.env.production` and fill in the real backend URL.
#
# IMPORTANT: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` is inlined into the client JavaScript
# bundle at *build* time, not read at container startup — setting it
# here alone is not enough for a Docker build. Pass the same value as
# the `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` build ARG (see docker-compose.prod.yml /
# frontend/Dockerfile's `builder` stage) so the value baked into the
# built bundle actually matches this file.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-backend-domain.example.com
